<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate.ejs") %>

<header class="bg-primary text-white text-center py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="display-4">Tribal Museum Bhopal</h1>
        <p class="lead">Celebrating the vibrant culture of India’s tribal communities</p>
    </div>
</header>

<div class="container my-5">
    <img src="https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/16/d9/90/ac/img-20190317-wa0012-largejpg.jpg?w=900&h=-1&s=1"
        class="hero-img rounded mb-4" alt="Tribal Museum Bhopal">

    <section>
        <h2>History</h2>
        <p>The Tribal Museum in Bhopal was inaugurated in 2013 to honor and preserve the art, lifestyle, and traditions of Madhya Pradesh’s indigenous tribes. It was developed by the Department of Culture, Government of Madhya Pradesh, and has become a unique cultural landmark showcasing living tribal traditions in a contemporary setting.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-4">
        <h2>Geography and Significance</h2>
        <p>Located near the Shyamla Hills, the museum sits amidst Bhopal’s cultural corridor and is close to attractions like the State Museum and Van Vihar. It plays a crucial role in documenting and reviving tribal customs and rituals through interactive galleries, life-sized exhibits, and multimedia installations.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-4">
        <h2>Activities and Attractions</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Tribal Art Displays:</strong> View murals, sculptures, and models depicting tribal homes and gods.</li>
            <li><strong>Cultural Programs:</strong> The museum hosts folk dance and music events by tribal artists.</li>
            <li><strong>Interactive Galleries:</strong> Features touchscreens, audio guides, and engaging stories of tribal heroes.</li>
            <li><strong>Photography:</strong> A colorful paradise for photographers and cultural explorers.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-4">
        <h2>Environmental Importance</h2>
        <p>The museum emphasizes harmony with nature — a core belief of tribal communities. Exhibits reflect the sustainable lifestyles of the tribes and aim to educate visitors about eco-friendly living and nature conservation as practiced traditionally by indigenous people.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-5">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="mb-4">User Reviews</h2>

        <!-- Review Form -->
        <form action="/bhopal/<%= place %>/review" method="POST" id="reviewForm" class="mb-5">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="mb-3 col-12 col-sm-6 col-md-4">
                    <label for="reviewRating" class="form-label">Rating</label>
                    <select name="rating" class="form-select" id="reviewRating" required>
                        <option value="" disabled selected>Select rating</option>
                        <option value="5">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ - Excellent</option>
                        <option value="4">⭐⭐⭐⭐ - Very Good</option>
                        <option value="3">⭐⭐⭐ - Good</option>
                        <option value="2">⭐⭐ - Fair</option>
                        <option value="1">⭐ - Poor</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3 col-12">
                    <label for="reviewText" class="form-label">Your Review</label>
                    <textarea name="comment" class="form-control" id="reviewText" rows="4" required></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="col-12">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Submit Review</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>

        <!-- Reviews List -->
        <div id="reviewsList">
            <% if (reviews.length === 0) { %>
                <p class="text-muted">No reviews yet. Be the first to write one!</p>
            <% } %>
            <div class="row ">
                <% reviews.forEach(review => { %>
                    <div class="singleReview card col-12 col-sm-6 col-lg-3 mb-4 mx-md-1 ">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h4 class="card-title"><%= review.author.username %></h4>
                            <p class="card-text"><%= review.comment %></p>
                            <p class="card-text">
                                <%= '⭐'.repeat(review.rating) %> 
                            </p>

                            <!-- Edit and Delete Buttons -->
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-start">
                                <a href="/bhopal/<%= place %>/review/<%= review._id %>/edit" class="btn btn-outline-primary mx-2">Edit</a>
                                <form method="POST" action="/bhopal/<%= place %>/review/<%= review._id %>?_method=DELETE" >
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger">Delete</button>
                                </form>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                <% }) %>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
